      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>HOW TO NAVIGATE ROUNDABOUTS SAFELY:</b>


    1. <b>REDUCE SPEED:</b>
    Slow down before entering (< 25 km/h).

    2. <b>GIVE WAY TO RIGHT:</b> Vehicles
    already circulating have priority. Wait for a safe opening.

    3. <b>CIRCULATE
    CLOCKWISE:</b> Follow traffic around the central island.

    4. <b>SIGNAL BEFORE
    EXITING:</b> Press <b>Q</b> or <b>E</b> to indicate before turning off.

    5.
    <b>YIELD TO PEDESTRIANS:</b> Stop at zebra crossings on entry and exit arms.'
